Z||000000||sjp777||06-26-2001||08:38 PM||||I'm ready to go with black carpet. Since ACC is down and Mr Mikes no longer sells them it seems my only alternative is fiero store.<P>From what I understand it is supposed to install over the stock carpet. That would be great for more sound deadening, but how does it fit? I'm worried it might interfere with the full clutch pedal travel.<P>Anybody have the scoop on it?<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg"> <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||5
